Subject: [PATCH 78/79] Runtime: optional external settings UI
 (ps2_ui_external.h): launcher in the runner's window before the game is
 resolved (openLauncherWindow; initialize reuses the window and GS,
 PS2ExternalGS::settingsChanged), per-frame menu hold (EeScheduler::setHeld,
 SPU2 stream paused) or quit, host pad filter; Esc is not the exit key with a
 UI

